{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0672B0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"当成一个假设来听吧。假如要制造一个你的克隆人……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"克隆？Para-Medic也说过这种话，但人类克隆不是科幻故事吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":79,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"所以才说是假设。那不说克隆也行。你有孩子吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"没有。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"结过婚吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"……我从没被那种东西束缚过。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"那这个也当成假设。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"假设你有个继承了你<R=基因,GENE>的儿子。如果他拥有和你完全相同的战斗能力，你会向他挑战吗？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=基因,GENE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":129,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"……嗯。不是我自负，但我会尽量避免和那家伙战斗。谁都不能保证我能活下来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"也是。毕竟你转眼就识破了Pupa-5000的战斗模式。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"那是因为有博士的建议。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"如果光听别人说说就能做到，谁还会辛苦。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"你一定是天生的士兵。嗯……或者可以说是“士兵基因”，你大概生来就拥有适合战斗的基因。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":126,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"……适合战斗的基因？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"就算研究再先进，把什么都归到基因头上也不太对吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"归到基因头上……这很奇怪吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"……什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"难道你觉得，我天生的这副身体和基因完全没有关系吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"这个我不知道……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"……听好了。你面对和自己拥有同等战斗力的对手时，会产生恐惧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"……把这种恐惧扩展到核战略层面，就是所谓的核威慑。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"也就是说，双方都拥有具备致命破坏力的核武器，为了避免同归于尽，反而会回避核战争。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"这个想法嘛，说白了还挺普通的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"没错。原则非常简单。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"但正因为简单，它能不能正常发挥作用，全看使用它的人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"从这个意义上说，我们眼前正在发生的，就是威慑理论的功能失灵。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"Coldman……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":16,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"对。别让核威慑就这样死掉。拜托了，Snake。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":59,"review_flag":""}]}